      <p>If you want to track your work with Git, initialize the repository now, as described in <a href="/dogsbay-xml-dita-tutorial-docs/start-here/set-up#optional-track-your-work-with-git">Track your work with Git</a>. Git does not track empty folders, so there is nothing to commit until stage 01 adds the first topic.</p>
      <h2 id="step-3-check-your-work" class="group scroll-mt-20">Step 3: Check your work<a href="#step-3-check-your-work" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-pagefind-ignore>&para;</a></h2>
